Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl changes... Becoming bright,\Nkind, and cheerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A girl changes... Becoming dark,\Nfierce, and cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:46.46,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Eleven:\N'Angel of the Starry Night'"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I... Did it happen again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. To be honest, my mind's been\Ngoing blank from time to time lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mind's been going blank?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's nothing to worry about.\NI'm probably just anemic or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm guessing you read\Nthe note I left on your desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah. You're free Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's all I wanted to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi, I take it your true self's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You see right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, this makes it difficult\Nto discover why Origami turned Inverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but this Origami came to\Naccept the death of her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In which case, why did she...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go over this once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This world is a result of you using\NKurumi's time travel powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...to save Origami's parents,\Nwho should've died five years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...in order to rewrite\Nthe history that follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I know why you've been\Nacting strange since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, Origami Tobiichi,\Nwho shouldn't have inversed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...has done so in this world\Nand exists now as Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.25,0:03:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've analyzed her encounter with Shin\Non the roof and it shows he's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi hasn't the\Nfaintest idea she's a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But how can that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, you managed to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But only you and Kurumi have knowledge\Nof the original world, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As for Kurumi, her own powers\Nbrought this about, so she's an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And, guessing from your situation,\Nto retain knowledge of the original world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,two conditions must be met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Being hit by Kurumi's Yod Bet, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...having Spirit powers\Nflowing through oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With both those combined, memory of\Nthe original world may be recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:04:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Possibly. Origami was shot by Kurumi's\NYod Bet and went back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to Shido's world change,\Nshe's lived a peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when Phantom showed up\Nand gave her Spirit powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's when she remembered it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, as a self-defense mechanism,\Nher memories were split in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Essentially, there's Origami \Nwho lives in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and the Spirit-Hunting Spirit, Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As soon as Origami senses Spirit power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she loses control of her mind and memory...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and she's awakened as an Inverse type...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The theory works and it's consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's true, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as Origami's a Spirit,\Nthere's only one thing for Ratatoskr to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make her fall for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. And seal her Spirit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll need to convince\NOrigami to go out on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--And then we can begin our--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Uh...\N--And then we can begin our--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:00.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! You already promised\Nto meet this Saturday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're telling me you hit on her\Nbefore even knowing she's a Spirit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Writing a note and stuff... Since when\Ndid I become such a girly girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think... Is this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's from Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:38.73,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"Itsuka"\N"Shido Itsuka"\N"Sorry to invite you out of nowhere and thanks for your answer. How does Saturday at 11 in front of the station's water fountain sound?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotta reply!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That date and time is all right with m--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that too impersonal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Dear Itsuka, the winds of autumn\Ncarry in this sentimental season.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:54.24,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"Dear Itsuka,\Nthe winds of autumn carry\Nin this sentimental season. As the moon shines like a great egg in the sky, how are you faring this"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As the moon shines like a great egg\Nin the sky, how are you faring this--"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of girl says that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I appreciate you inviting \Nme out today, Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since we're classmates and all,\Ncan we cut the formalities please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Understood. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good. That's more like the\NOrigami I know. Sorry, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I keep calling you that.\NIt's such a pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. I'm glad\Nmy parents picked it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what you want to call me,\NI'm fine with you using "Origami."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can just call me Shido, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Once I know you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief, this is unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? What are our plans today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good question...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.68,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"1. Head to the movie theater\Nand watch a love story together.\N2. Go shopping somewhere fun with her. 3. Skip the boring stuff and go straight to an adult hotel."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go. Your choices, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:57.18,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"...story together.\N...fun with her.\N...adult hotel."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, seems right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:07:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hate to pass up choice one, but going\Nsomewhere they can't talk is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's more, two is a\Nsafe and versatile choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's not a woman alive\Nwho hates shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, we're ready. Two is--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold up a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna test out a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Emotional levels unstable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi is distraught!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn right she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you thinking, Shido?!\NTalk your way out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry, it's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so that wasn't it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought Origami would be crazy for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, go with two. Take the girl shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is her happiness level now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hopefully it didn't drop too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her emotions are fluctuating, but her\Nhappiness might actually be rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we going shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:05.42,OS,,0000,0000,0000,,"1. Find her an outfit at a clothing store.\N2. Play with animals at the pet shop.\N3. Go to a shady pharmacy selling aphrodisiacs and love potions."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your choices, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. This has gotta be three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't take a girl there on a first date!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami and aphrodisiacs go together\Nlike peanut butter and jelly, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's this, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand\Nwhat this store's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! W-Why do I have all this stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.92,0:08:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did I grab all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. It's my fault for\Ntaking you to that weird store anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:09:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll buy you an outfit as\Nan apology. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? No, I can't let you--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In exchange, let me be the\Nfirst to see you wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the only payment I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka, do you make girls cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem too used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not true at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, I guess I'll take you up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And while I'm at it, I should pick out\Nan outfit you might like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You make girls cry!\NShe sees right through you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gimme a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never said it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, Origami went into\Na dressing room in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't lose sight of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't, Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you pick that out because\Nyou thought I'd like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Don't get me wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even remember taking\Nthese clothes off the rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, yet again...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, I'm weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let it bother you.\NIt doesn't even faze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I need to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This isn't what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your spoon fell off the table,\Nso I was just picking it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.64,0:11:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing, don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll dry in a jiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Why am I...? No! Believe me, Itsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami Tobiichi's emotional\Nlevels have stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her happiness meter still remains high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The mood isn't bad either, so maybe\Nwe can wrap it up in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, she seems to be\Nanxious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps whether Shin will\Naccept her for who she is or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not surprised, after all she did...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All we need is one more push.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? So you're done with the AST then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:12:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my anemia and mind going\Nblank are both reasons for it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I just don't know anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...if wiping out Spirits\Nis the right thing to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. It was a Spirit responsible\Nfor killing your brother, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be sorry for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying you're not wrong\Nto think that way to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I mean, my brother would\Nsay the same thing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness meter climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maximum value was reached!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm. That must have been\Nthe source of her earlier anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, it's looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time you dove in for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all right, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot. Her Spirit power is--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Inverse type...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this I'm sensing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shiver. My heart is restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami is after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.71,0:14:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The only chance to seal her is while\Nher Spirit armor is incomplete!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I run away, the city will get demolished!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...do something like that ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Step back, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yggdrafolium?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll use Fraxinus' main battery to break\Nher Spirit barrier for three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Use that chance to get close and seal--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.13,0:15:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...? Again...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all right, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, who in the world is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sense dreadful Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's... Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The transfer student?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too dangerous to fight her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should probably tell \Nyou to run away, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you help me try to save her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido is the one who saved me.\NShido made my world possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, it's my turn to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did I lose consciousness again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was just with Itsuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...my...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.81,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Middle School Entrance Ceremony"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, we'll distract her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Suggestion. Go while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it up, Kaguya! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rondo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,March!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck, Natsumi?!\NYou're such a copycat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've always wanted to try that once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, he can't even get close...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, you've got to reach her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zadkiel, Shiryon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Save the transfer student!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Open up... your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one who killed my dad and mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That never happened in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because Itsuka's brother...\NNo, because Itsuka himself saved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what about my memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I ever take back\Nthe truth that I killed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am you. You are me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the world is remade,\Nthese memories will always remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no hope for me now.\NSo that means you, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:19:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop... Enough, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why is Shido...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't carry the burden alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you five years ago!\NYou're not alone! I'm here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of your sadness and hate--\NI'll carry all of it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're lost, lean on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When something happens\Nand it's too much, rely on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything... It's okay\Nto dump everything on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So... So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let despair take over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how many worlds you try to break,\NI'll come and do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:20:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come and save you, no matter\Nhow much despair you're in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reach out to me, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you weren't here for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.09,0:20:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I would've done something else\NI couldn't take back...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fact that I killed my dad\Nand mom will never go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nor will my sin of all those\NI killed in the original world...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll stay with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:21:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's made to never happen at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. That's a burden\Nyou'll always have to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, I have to apologize to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The feelings I've had towards you\Nwere not love or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just relying on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I lost my parents, I had\Nno choice... but to cling to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because you relied on me\Nthat I was able to free you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, I've got something\Nof yours to give back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I held onto more than\Njust tears for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Origami...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief. We're never\Ngonna learn our limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:22:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, I have something\Nto wipe your tears with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you doing, Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,School swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Retains moisture well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got these for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When all that happened, didn't you say\Nyou never loved me and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.21,0:23:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.04,0:23:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...my true love begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.55,0:23:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You better stay away from Shido, Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.72,0:23:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:41.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Twelve:\N'Make Shido Itsuka Swoon'"
